wright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2016\/post-281796-0-81067000-1469963993_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":750}],"Id":1915103,"PostDate":1469964814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm ready to sell my leftover wedding decor items! I live in Hollywood, Florida, zip code 33021. Prices do not include shipping.<br><br>\nChair Caps & Runner:<br>\nThese chair caps can be used with chiavari chairs. I received many compliments on these. The colors are bright and they added a finished, elegant touch to my wedding decor.<br>\nThe sale price is $80 + shipping if needed and includes-<br>\n30 purple rosette chair caps<br>\n1 purple rosette runner<br>\n10 turquoise rosette chair caps<br>\nMeasures:Approx. 16\" wide x 14\" long <br>\nMaterial: Satin<br><br><br>\nPurple Betsey Johnson Shoes 8 1\/2 - $60:<br>\nBlue by Betsey Johnson Gown Evening Pumps Women's Shoes size 8.5 with box. Heel is 4.25. Retail price is $129. The shoe color is purple and they are gorgeous! I wore these for about 20 minutes for my wedding pictures.<br><br><br>\n20 Flower Tote Bags - $40:<br>\nI bought these hibiscus totes to use for my out of town goodie bag and they were a huge hit. I've since used them as gift bags and they'd be great party favors. They are brand new with tags attached. Made of canvas-like polyester and equipped with a 8\u00bd\" double-reinforced. The measurements are 36 -- 14\u00bex10\u00bd.<br><br>\nI have 20 bags in total:<br>\n14 purple<br>\n5 turquoise <br>\n1 black<br>\nSelling all for $40.00 + shipping if needed<br><br><br>\nStarfish 33 total - $25:<br>\nI used these starfish as escort cards \/ name card holders for my reception. They are painted a shiny silver and looked gorgeous with my beach theme.<br>\n10 medium sized starfish<br>\n23 small knobby starfish<br>\nSelling all for $25 plus shipping if needed.<br><br><br>\n17 Purple Lanyards with Card Holders - $20:<br>\nBrand new, never used. These are leftover items from my out of town bags I put together for my wedding. <br><br><br>\n14 Plastic Tumblers with Lids & Straws - $10:<br>\nBrand new, never used and still in the store box. I bought a case for wedding favors and these were left over. 16-oz. Double-Wall Plastic Tumblers with Screw-On Lids and Plastic Straws.<br><br>\nI included a picture with my wedding stickers for ideas but the ones I am selling do not have the stickers. <br>\n14 in total<br>\n6 turquoise <br>\n8 clear<br>\nExtra straws and lids included<br><br><br>\n36 Small Bubble Wands - $10<br>\nStill in box, never used. I added a purple ribbon which you can remove easily. The top of each wand is heart shaped.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandra_co8@icloud.com","IpAddress":"50.162.188.193","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421707270,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sandraco8","Id":281796,"Name":"Sandraco8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.90.129.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80220,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b027a8b122df0b718774c9d5f37f9de","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ! I love the starfish if they are still available pls let me know. I live in Orlando FL&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915